  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy for Resilience in Syria-ECHO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to reduce access to electricity has severely impacted all aspects of daily life in Syria, particularly in conflict-affected urban and peri-urban areas. This project aims to strengthen the resilience of communities by enhancing access to stable and reliable electricity which is critical for access to essential services and improving economic conditions. The project will focus on the installation of eight electrical trans-formers along with medium and low voltage distribution net</narrative>
  </description>
